IMPORTANT — NOT LEGAL ADVICE
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Nyaya provides legal *information / guidance*, not legal advice. It is not a
substitute for a licensed advocate. The practice of law in India is reserved
for advocates enrolled under the Advocates Act, 1961. Any deployment must
carry a prominent "not legal advice — consult a licensed advocate" disclaimer
and route users to free legal aid (NALSA / DLSA, Legal Services Authorities
Act, 1987) where appropriate.

